{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30376","headline":"送滕迈郎中赴睦州 · 赵嘏","name":"送滕迈郎中赴睦州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡斋秋尽一江横，频命郎官地更清。\n星月去随新诏动，旌旗遥映故山明。\n诗寻片石依依晚，帆挂孤云杳杳轻。\n想到钓台逢竹马，只应歌咏伴猿声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}